{"2500410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "King Island 2", "steam_appid": 2500410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.poster.avif?t=1744030563\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.webm?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.mp4?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive back into the captivating world of King's Island, where every click immerses you deeper into a realm brimming with danger and magic. Another classic point and click Flash RPG of the King Island Franchise, navigate through intricate landscapes, interact with objects, and engage in dynamic battles! <br><br>Whether you missed the first installment or are a seasoned player, the journey ahead promises new challenges, treasures, and revelations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.poster.avif?t=1744030563\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.webm?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.mp4?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore the intricacies of combat as you strategize your moves, exploiting enemy weaknesses and leveraging your arsenal of potions, scrolls, and spells. From the thundering strikes of a warrior's blade to the arcane incantations of a mage's staff, every action shapes your destiny. <br><br>Unravel the mysteries of the arcane arts, mastering spells and abilities that evolve with your character's progression. But beware, for every foe vanquished brings new trials, and every victory heralds greater threats.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.poster.avif?t=1744030563\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.webm?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.mp4?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Customize your character's attributes and abilities, forging a path tailored to your playstyle. Will you hone your strength and agility, becoming a formidable melee warrior? Or will you delve into the arcane mysteries, wielding the powers of magic to reshape the battlefield? The choices you make will determine your fate and the fate of King's Island itself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.poster.avif?t=1744030563\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.webm?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.mp4?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Venture forth, brave adventurer, and write your own legend amidst the tumult of battle and the whispers of ancient magic. Uncover the truth behind Kaptivo's transformation, confront mythical creatures, and forge alliances in a world teetering on the brink of chaos. <br><br>The journey awaits, and only you can decide the fate of this enchanted realm.<br><br><br><br><strong>Developer Note: </strong><br><br>This game is a 2008 artifact developed by a small indie team using the full potential and limitations of flash technology. We apologize for any technical problems or inconveniences you may encounter in your playthrough, or issues with the German and Spanish translations. We hope that with these limitations in mind, you may still enjoy the experience!<br><br>", "about_the_game": "<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.poster.avif?t=1744030563\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.webm?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500410/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.mp4?t=1744030563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive back into the captivating world of King's Island, where every click immerses you deeper into a realm brimming with danger and magic. Another classic point and click Flash RPG of the King Island Franchise, navigate through intricate landscapes, interact with objects, and engage in dynamic battles! <br><br>Whether you missed the first installment or are a seasoned player, the journey ahead promises new challenges, treasures, and revelations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline